<title>INDIA: India RBI to auction 3.0 bln rupees 91-day t-bills.</title>
<headline>India RBI to auction 3.0 bln rupees 91-day t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it will hold an auction of 91-day treasury bills on Friday, April 25, for a sum of 3 billion rupees.</p>
<p>Results will be announced the same day and payment by successful bidders will be on Saturday, the RBI said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
